                    "line": 877,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alpana07",
                        "email": "alpu8007@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Alpana07"
                    },
                    "message": "do we have something as \"empty parameter\"? Informing about EMPTY parameter would be  more concrete."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/vpd_specific_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 877,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "RekhaAparna01",
                        "email": "vrekhaaparna@ibm.com",
                        "username": "RekhaAparna01"
                    },
                    "message": "empty parameter means it is an invalid input. we are using the same error code in all the APIs."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/vpd_specific_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 877,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "SunnySrivastava",
                        "email": "sunnsr25@in.ibm.com",
                        "username": "SunnySrivastava1984"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/vpd_specific_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 886,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Souvik Roy",
                        "email": "souvikroyofficial10@gmail.com",
                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "This `if` is combining two conditions:\n1. Invalid keyword type read from D-Bus\n2. Valid keyword type but value is invalid.\n\nI think we should split the `if` and also check for `RECEIVED_INVALID_KWD_TYPE_FROM_DBUS` so that caller can have greater clarity on the failure."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/vpd_specific_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 886,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "I think both can be same for this API, as expected CCIN value is of 4 bytes array should be received, in any case of mismatch from expected value we can considered as invalid value received for this API."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/include/utility/vpd_specific_utility.hpp",
                    "line": 886,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "RekhaAparna01",
                        "email": "vrekhaaparna@ibm.com",
                        "username": "RekhaAparna01"
                    },
                    "message": "updated"
                },
